    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin pneumococcique polyosidique conjugué, 20-valent, adsorbé, sérotypes 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F et 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Pneumokokken-Polysaccharid-Konjugatimpfstoff, 20-valent, adsorbiert, Serotypen 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F und 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Polisacharydowa szczepionka pneumokokowa, 20-walentna, adsorbowana, serotypy 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F i 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Πνευμονιοκοκκικό πολυσακχαριδικό συζευγμένο εμβόλιο, 20δύναμο, προσροφημένο, ορότυποι 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F και 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Pneimokoku polisaharīdu konjugētā vakcīna, 20-valenta, adsorbēta, 1., 3., 4., 5., 6.A, 6.A, 6.B, 7.F, 8., 9.V, 10.A, 11.A, 12.F, 14., 15.B, 18.C, 19.A, 19.F, 22.F, 23.F un 33.F serotips</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina conjugada de polissacarídeos pneumocócicos, 20-valente, adsorvida, serótipos 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F e 33F</rdfs:comment>
