    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à virus entier inactivé (culture sur cellules Vero)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, whole virion inactivated (Vero cell culture)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, ganzes Virion inaktiviert (Vero-Zellkultur)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, cały wirus inaktywowany (hodowla komórkowa Vero)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, virião inteiro inactivado (cultura de células Vero)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, inaktivēta ar veselu virionu (Vero šūnu kultūra)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, ολόκληρο ιό αδρανοποιημένο (κυτταροκαλλιέργεια Vero)</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-05-15</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0696</skos:notation>
