    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin pédiatrique diphtérique (anatoxine, dose standard), tétanique (anatoxine) et coquelucheux (entier inactivé)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Paediatric diphtheria vaccine (toxoid, standard dose), tetanus vaccine (toxoid) and pertussis vaccine (whole inactivated)</rdfs:comment>
