    <skos:hiddenLabel>PURIVAX</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0128">
    <rdfs:label>HB VAX DNA 10 µg</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin recombinant contre l'hépatite B, dosé à 10 microgrammes d'antigène HBs (bien que dosé à 10 µg, ce vaccin est indiqué à partir de l'âge de 16 ans)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Recombinant hepatitis B vaccine with 10 micrograms of HBs antigen (although 10 µg, this vaccine is indicated from the age of 16)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Rekombinanter Hepatitis-B-Impfstoff mit 10 Mikrogramm HBs-Antigen (obwohl 10 µg, ist dieser Impfstoff ab dem Alter von 16 Jahren angezeigt)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina recombinante contra a hepatite B com 10 microgramas de antigénio HBs (embora 10 µg, esta vacina é indicada a partir dos 16 anos de idade)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Rekombinowana szczepionka przeciwko wirusowemu zapaleniu wątroby typu B z 10 mikrogramami antygenu HBs (mimo że 10 µg, szczepionka ta jest wskazana od 16 roku życia)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο ανασυνδυασμένης ηπατίτιδας Β με 10 μικρογραμμάρια αντιγόνου HBs (αν και 10 μg, το εμβόλιο αυτό ενδείκνυται από την ηλικία των 16 ετών)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">rekombinantā B hepatīta vakcīna ar 10 mikrogramiem HBs antigēna (lai gan 10 μg, šī vakcīna ir indicēta no 16 gadu vecuma).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-11-25</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0128</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL114"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>HBVAXDNA10µg</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.esante.gouv.fr/NUVA/nuvs#containsValence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://data.esante.gouv.fr/NUVA/nuvs#containedInVaccine"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0479">
    <rdfs:label>TRIAXIS</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin diphtérique (anatoxine, dose réduite), tétanique (anatoxine) et coquelucheux (acellulaire multicomposé, dose réduite)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Impfstoff gegen Diphtherie-Toxoid (niedrige Dosis), Tetanus-Toxoid und azelluläre Multikomponenten-Pertussis (niedrige Dosis)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Difterijas toksoīda (neliela deva), stingumkrampju toksoīda un daudzkomponentu akcelulārās garo klepusas (neliela deva) vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra difteria toxoide (dose baixa), tétano toxoide e coqueluche acelular multicomponente (dose baixa)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka zawierająca toksoid błoniczy (niska dawka), toksoid tężcowy i wieloskładnikową szczepionkę acelularną przeciwko krztuścowi (niska dawka)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο διφθερίτιδας τοξοειδούς (χαμηλή δόση), τοξοειδούς τετάνου και πολυσύνθετο εμβόλιο οξυτενούς κοκκύτη (χαμηλή δόση)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (low dose), tetanus toxoid and pertussis (multicomponent acellular, low dose) vaccine</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0479</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL067"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL034"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL017"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>triaxis</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>triaksis</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0697">
    <rdfs:label>V590 (COVID-19)</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à vecteur viral réplicatif, virus de la stomatite vésiculaire codant la protéine de pointe du SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, replicating vesicular stomatitis virus vector encoding the SARS-CoV-2 spike protein</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, replizierender Vesikuläre Stomatitis-Virus-Vektor, der für das SARS-CoV-2-Spike-Protein kodiert</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, αναπαραγόμενος φορέας του ιού της φυσαλιδώδους στοματίτιδας που κωδικοποιεί την πρωτεΐνη αιχμής SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, replicando o vector do vírus da estomatite vesicular que codifica a proteína do espigão SRA-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, replikujący się wektor wirusa pęcherzykowego zapalenia jamy ustnej kodujący białko kolca SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, replicējošs vezikulārā stomatīta vīrusa vektors, kas kodē SARS-CoV-2 smailes proteīnu.</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-05-15</dct:modified>
