  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0694">
    <rdfs:label>LMU-MVA-SARS-2-S-COVID</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, non-replicating modified Vaccinia Virus Ankara vector encoding the SARS-CoV-2 spike protein</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à vecteur non réplicatif, vaccine Ankara modifiée codant la protéine de pointe du SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, nicht replizierender modifizierter Vaccinia-Virus-Ankara-Vektor, der für das SARS-CoV-2-Spike-Protein kodiert</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, μη αναπαραγόμενος τροποποιημένος φορέας Vaccinia Virus Ankara που κωδικοποιεί την πρωτεΐνη αιχμής SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, niereplikujący się zmodyfikowany wektor wirusa Vaccinia Virus Ankara kodujący białko kolca SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, neatjaunojošs modificēts vakcīnas vīrusa Ankara vektors, kas kodē SARS-CoV-2 smailes proteīnu.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, Vaccinia Virus Ankara modificado não replicável codificando a proteína spike SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0694</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL054"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>LMU-MVA-SARS-2-S-Covid</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0561">
    <rdfs:label>IMOJEV</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
