    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin polyosidique non conjugué contre les méningocoques des sérogroupes A et C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unconjugated meningococcal polysaccharide vaccine, serogroups A and C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Nicht-konjugierter Polysaccharid-Impfstoff gegen Meningokokken der Serogruppen A und C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina polissacárida não conjugada contra os serogrupos meningocócicos A e C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Nieskoniugowana szczepionka polisacharydowa przeciwko serogrupom meningokokowym A i C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Nekonjugēta polisaharīdu vakcīna pret A un C meningokoka serogrupu infekciju</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Μη συζευγμένο πολυσακχαριδικό εμβόλιο κατά των οροομάδων Α και C του μηνιγγιτιδόκοκκου</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-16</dct:modified>
