  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0714">
    <rdfs:label>VACCIN CONTRE LA COVID-19 (INACTIVE, AVEC ADJUVANT) VALNEVA</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin entier inactivé cultivé sur cellules Vero, adjuvé avec CpG 1018 (cytosine phospho-guanine) en combinaison avec de l'hydroxyde d'aluminium - Autre nom : Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, whole virion inactivated, adjuvanted with CpG 10183 ! (cytosine phospho-guanine) a) in combination with aluminium hydroxide - Other name: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, inaktiviertes Vollvirus, adjuvantiert mit CpG 10183 , (Cytosin-Phospho-Guanin) a) in Kombination mit Aluminiumhydroxid - Andere Bezeichnung: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, inaktywowany cały wirus, adiuwant z CpG 10183 , (fosfoguanina cytozyny) a) w połączeniu z wodorotlenkiem glinu - Inna nazwa: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, ολόκληρο ιό αδρανοποιημένο, ενισχυμένο με CpG 10183 , (φωσφο-γουανίνη κυτοσίνης) α) σε συνδυασμό με υδροξείδιο του αργιλίου - Άλλη ονομασία: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, virião inteiro inactivado, adjuvante com CpG 10183 , (citosina fosfo-guanina) a) em combinação com hidróxido de alumínio - Outro nome: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, inaktivēta ar veselu vīrionu, ar CpG 10183 , (citozīnfosfogvanīns) a) kombinācijā ar alumīnija hidroksīdu - Cits nosaukums: Valneva VLA2001</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-11-09</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0714</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL264"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>VLA2001</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>COVID-19 VACCINE VALNEVA</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
