  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0669">
    <rdfs:label>ARCTURUS-RNA-COVID</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à ARNm codant la protéine de pointe du SARS-CoV-2, en cours d'essai clinique</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, mRNA encoding the SARS-CoV-2 spike protein, ongoing clinical trial</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, mRNA, die für das SARS-CoV-2-Spike-Protein kodiert, laufende klinische Prüfung</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, mRNS, kas kodē SARS-CoV-2 smailes proteīnu, pašlaik notiek klīniskais pētījums</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, mRNA kodujące białko kolca SARS-CoV-2, trwające badanie kliniczne</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, mRNA que codifica a proteína do pico da SRA-CoV-2, ensaio clínico em curso</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, mRNA που κωδικοποιεί την πρωτεΐνη SARS-CoV-2 spike, σε εξέλιξη κλινική δοκιμή</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0669</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL135"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>covid19</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>arncovid19arcturus</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0754">
    <rdfs:label>INACTIVATED KOCAK-19 INAKTIF ADJUVANT COVID-19 VACCINE</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à virus entier inactivé, adjuvé (adjuvant non précisé)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, whole virion inactivated, adjuvanted (adjuvant unspecified)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, Vollvirus inaktiviert, adjuvantiert (Adjuvans nicht spezifiziert)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, ολόκληρο ιό αδρανοποιημένο, επικουρικό (επικουρικό απροσδιόριστο)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, virião inteiro inactivado, adjuvante (adjuvante não especificado)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">COVID-19 szczepionka, cały wirus inaktywowany, adiuwant (adiuwant nieokreślony)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, inaktivēta ar veselu virionu, ar adjuvantu (adjuvants nav precizēts).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0754</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL265"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0403">
    <rdfs:label>TRINIVAC</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin pédiatrique diphtérique (anatoxine, dose standard), tétanique (anatoxine) et coquelucheux (entier inactivé)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Diphtherie-Toxoid (Standarddosis), Tetanus-Toxoid und inaktivierter Keuchhusten-Vollzellimpfstoff für Kinder</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Παιδιατρικό εμβόλιο διφθεριτικού τοξοειδούς (τυπική δόση), τετανικού τοξοειδούς και αδρανοποιημένου κοκκύτη ολικού κυττάρου</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina pediátrica contra difteria toxoide (dose padrão), tétano toxoide e tosse convulsa inativada de células inteiras</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Toksoid błoniczy (dawka standardowa), toksoid tężcowy i inaktywowana całokomórkowa szczepionka przeciw krztuścowi dla dzieci</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Difterijas toksoīda (standarta deva), stingumkrampju toksoīda un pilnšūnu inaktivētas garo klepusakcīnas pediatriskā vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (standard dose), tetanus toxoid and pertussis (whole-cell inactivated) pediatric vaccine</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-11-02</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0403</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL097"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL067"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL010"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>TRINIVAC</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0972">
    <rdfs:label>VIROFLUSOMA</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-06-13</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Trivalent inactivated seasonal influenza vaccine, surface antigen</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin contre la grippe saisonnière inactivé trivalent, à antigène de surface</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Trivalenter inaktivierter saisonaler Grippeimpfstoff mit Oberflächenantigen</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina trivalente inactivada contra a gripe sazonal com antigénio de superfície</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Trójwartościowa inaktywowana szczepionka przeciwko grypie sezonowej z antygenem powierzchniowym</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Τρισθενές αδρανοποιημένο εμβόλιο εποχικής γρίπης με επιφανειακό αντιγόνο</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Trivalenta inaktivēta sezonālās gripas vakcīna ar virsmas antigēnu</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-16</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0972</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL015"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
