    <skos:hiddenLabel>polioralberna</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0621">
    <rdfs:label>MENC VACCINE FUNED</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Meningokokken-C-Konjugatimpfstoff (hergestellt von der Ezequiel Dias Foundation)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka skoniugowana przeciwko meningokokom typu C (wyprodukowana przez Fundację Ezequiela Diasa)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Meningokoka C konjugētā vakcīna (ražo Ezequiel Dias Foundation)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina Conjugada Meningococcal C (Produzida pela Fundação Ezequiel Dias)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Μενιγγιτιδοκοκκικό C συζευγμένο εμβόλιο (παράγεται από το Ίδρυμα Ezequiel Dias)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Meningococcal conjugate Vaccine, serogroup C (conjugated to tetanus toxoid, Produced by the Ezequiel Dias Foundation)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin méningococcique polyosidique conjugué à l'anatoxine tétanique contre le sérogroupe C (Produit par la "Ezequiel Dias Foundation")</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0621</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL266"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>MenC</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>méningocoqueC</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>méningoC</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0091">
    <rdfs:label>VACCIN CCB PASTEUR</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A combination of inactivated bacteria to stimulate the immune system. CCB = against bronchial complications. Not really a vaccine...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Association de bactéries inactivées visant à stimuler le système immunitaire. CCB = contre les complications bronchiques. Pas vraiment un vaccin...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Eine Kombination von inaktivierten Bakterien zur Stimulierung des Immunsystems. CCB = gegen bronchiale Komplikationen. Nicht wirklich ein Impfstoff...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Inaktivētu baktēriju kombinācija imūnsistēmas stimulēšanai. CCB = pret bronhu komplikācijām. Nav īsti vakcīna...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Συνδυασμός αδρανοποιημένων βακτηρίων για τη διέγερση του ανοσοποιητικού συστήματος. CCB = κατά των βρογχικών επιπλοκών. Δεν είναι πραγματικά εμβόλιο...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Uma combinação de bactérias inactivadas para estimular o sistema imunitário. CCB = contra complicações brônquicas. Não é realmente uma vacina...</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Połączenie inaktywowanych bakterii w celu pobudzenia układu odpornościowego. CCB = przeciwko powikłaniom oskrzelowym. Tak naprawdę nie jest to szczepionka...</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-10-28</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0091</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL105"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>VACCIN CCB PASTEUR</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAL129">
