  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0884">
    <rdfs:label>DIF-PER-TET-ALL CHIRON</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-04-04</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin pédiatrique diphtérique (anatoxine, dose standard), tétanique (anatoxine), coquelucheux (acellulaire multicomposé, 3 composants, dose standard)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Diphtherie-Toxoid-Impfstoff (Standarddosis), Tetanus-Toxoid-Impfstoff und azellulärer Multikomponenten-Pertussis-Impfstoff (3 Komponenten, Standarddosis) für Kinder, adsorbiert</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Difterijas toksoīda (standarta deva), stingumkrampju toksoīda un daudzkomponentu akcelulārās garo klepusas (3 komponenti, standarta deva) bērnu vakcīna, adsorbēta</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina pediátrica contra difteria toxoide (dose padrão), tetano toxoide e tosse convulsa acelular multicomponente (3 componentes, dose padrão), adsorvida</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Toksoid błoniczy (dawka standardowa), toksoid tężcowy i wieloskładnikowa szczepionka acelularna przeciwko krztuścowi (3 składniki, dawka standardowa) dla dzieci, adsorbowana</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Παιδιατρικό εμβόλιο διφθερίτιδας (τυπική δόση), τοξοειδούς τετάνου και πολυσυσύνθετου κυτταρικού κοκκύτη (3 συστατικά, τυπική δόση), προσροφημένο</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (standard dose), tetanus toxoid and pertussis (multicomponent acellular, 3 components, standard dose) pediatric vaccine, adsorbed</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-07-31</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0884</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL097"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL067"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL008"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0799">
