    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Συζευγμένο εμβόλιο Haemophilus influenzae τύπου β (Hib) (συζευγμένο εμβόλιο πρωτεΐνης τετάνου)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina conjugada contra Haemophilus influenzae tipo b (Hib) (conjugado da proteína do tétano)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Haemophilus influenzae b tipa (Hib) konjugētā vakcīna (stingumkrampju proteīna konjugētā vakcīna)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Haemophilus influenzae type b conjugate vaccine (tetanus protein conjugate)</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-06-04</dct:modified>
