  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0482">
    <rdfs:label>VEPACEL</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin contre la grippe A(H5N1) (virion entier, cultivé sur cellule Vero, inactivé)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Influenza A(H5N1) vaccine (whole virion, Vero cell cultured, inactivated)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Influenza A(H5N1)-Impfstoff (ganzes Virion, Vero-Zellkultur, inaktiviert)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">A(H5N1) gripas vakcīna (veseli virioni, inaktivēta, kultivēta Vero šūnu kultūrā)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a gripe A(H5N1) (virião inteiro, célula Vero cultivada, inactivada)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko grypie A(H5N1) (cały wirion, hodowany w komórkach Vero, inaktywowany)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο κατά της γρίπης A(H5N1) (ολόκληρο ιό, καλλιέργεια κυττάρων Vero, αδρανοποιημένο)</rdfs:comment>
