    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, replicating measles virus vector encoding the SARS-CoV-2 spike protein</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, replizierender Masernvirus-Vektor, der für das SARS-CoV-2-Spike-Protein kodiert</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, replicando o vector do vírus do sarampo que codifica a proteína do espigão SRA-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, replikujący wektor wirusa odry kodujący białko kolca SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, replicējošs masalu vīrusa vektors, kas kodē SARS-CoV-2 smailes proteīnu</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, αναπαραγόμενος φορέας ιού ιλαράς που κωδικοποιεί την πρωτεΐνη αιχμής SARS-CoV-2</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-06-04</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0674</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL038"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>covid19</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>Pasteur-Measles-vector-Covid</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
