    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Nicht konjugierter Pneumokokken-Impfstoff, 23-valent, Serotypen 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6B, 7F, 8, 9N, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 17F, 18C, 19A, 19F, 20, 22F, 23F und 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Nieskoniugowana szczepionka przeciw pneumokokom, 23-walentna, serotypy 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6B, 7F, 8, 9N, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 17F, 18C, 19A, 19F, 20, 22F, 23F i 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Μη συζευγμένο πνευμονιοκοκκικό εμβόλιο, 23-δύναμο, ορότυποι 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6B, 7F, 8, 9N, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 17F, 18C, 19A, 19F, 20, 22F, 23F και 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina pneumocócica não conjugada, 23-valente, serótipos 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6B, 7F, 8, 9N, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 17F, 18C, 19A, 19F, 20, 22F, 23F e 33F</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Nekonjugēta pneimokoku vakcīna, 23-valenta, 1., 2., 3., 4., 4., 5., 6.B, 7.F, 8., 9.N, 9.V, 10.A, 11.A, 12.F, 14., 15.B, 17.F, 18.C, 19.A, 19.F, 20., 22.F, 23.F un 33.F serotipi.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unconjugated pneumococcal polysaccharide vaccine, 23-valent, serotypes 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6B, 7F, 8, 9N, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 17F, 18C, 19A, 19F, 20, 22F, 23F and 33F</rdfs:comment>
