  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0954">
    <rdfs:label>JAPANESE ENCEPHALITIS VACCINE</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-05-27</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin entier inactivé contre l'encéphalite japonaise, préparé sur tissu cérébral murin, souche Nakayama, voie injectable, vaccin de la Korean Green Cross Corporation</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Whole inactivated Japanese encephalitis vaccine, prepared in murine brain tissue, Nakayama strain, injectable, Korean Green Cross Corporation vaccine</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Inaktivierter Vollimpfstoff gegen Japanische Enzephalitis, hergestellt in Mäusegehirngewebe, Nakayama-Stamm, injizierbar, Korean Green Cross Corporation Impfstoff</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a encefalite japonesa totalmente inactivada, preparada em tecido cerebral murino, estirpe Nakayama, injectável, vacina da Korean Green Cross Corporation</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Ολόκληρο αδρανοποιημένο εμβόλιο ιαπωνικής εγκεφαλίτιδας, παρασκευασμένο σε εγκεφαλικό ιστό ποντικού, στέλεχος Nakayama, ενέσιμο, εμβόλιο Korean Green Cross Corporation</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Pilna inaktivēta Japānas encefalīta vakcīna, sagatavota no peļu smadzeņu audiem, Nakayama celms, injicējama, Korejas Zaļā krusta korporācijas vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Pełna inaktywowana szczepionka przeciwko japońskiemu zapaleniu mózgu, przygotowana w tkance mózgowej myszy, szczep Nakayama, do wstrzykiwań, szczepionka Korean Green Cross Corporation</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-01</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0954</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL250"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0869">
    <rdfs:label>MENPOVAX C</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-03-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin polyosidique non conjugué contre les méningocoques du sérogroupe C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Μη συζευγμένο πολυσακχαριδικό εμβόλιο κατά του μηνιγγιτιδόκοκκου, οροομάδα C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Nieskoniugowana polisacharydowa szczepionka meningokokowa, serogrupa C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Unkonjugierter Meningokokken-Polysaccharid-Impfstoff, Serogruppe C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina de polissacarídeo meningocócica não conjugada, serogrupo C</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Nekonjugēta meningokoku polisaharīdu vakcīna, C serogrupa</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unconjugated meningococcal polysaccharide vaccine, serogroup C</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-23</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0869</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL137"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>Menpovaxc</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>menpovax-c</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1053">
