    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Omicron XBB.1.5 subvariante covid 19 mRNA vaccine, 3 microgramas, dose pediátrica (6 meses-4 anos)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο Omicron XBB.1.5 subvariant covid 19 mRNA, 3 μικρογραμμάρια, παιδιατρική δόση (6 μηνών-4 ετών)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Omicron XBB.1.5 subvarianta kovid 19 mRNS vakcīna, 3 mikrogrami, pediatriskā deva (6 mēneši-4 gadi)</rdfs:comment>
