    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (standard dose), tetanus toxoid, pertussis (whole cell), Haemophilus influenzae type b (conjugated to tetanus toxoid), inactivated polio (trivalent) and hepatitis B (recombinant) pediatric vaccine, adsorbed</rdfs:comment>
