    <skos:hiddenLabel>mainitorix</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>ménitoriks</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>Menitorix</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0689">
    <rdfs:label>CHINESE-RECOMBINANT-Sf9-COVID</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à sous-unité protéique, protéine de pointe du SARS-CoV-2 recombinante, exprimées par Baculovirus cultivés sur cellules Sf9</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, protein subunit, recombinant spike protein, expressed by Baculovirus cultured on Sf9 cells</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, Proteinuntereinheit, rekombinantes Spike-Protein, exprimiert durch Baculovirus, kultiviert auf Sf9-Zellen</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, podjednostka białkowa, rekombinowane białko kolca, wyrażone przez bakulowirusa hodowanego na komórkach Sf9</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, πρωτεϊνική υπομονάδα, ανασυνδυασμένη πρωτεΐνη αιχμής, που εκφράζεται από Baculovirus καλλιεργημένο σε κύτταρα Sf9</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, subunidade de proteína, proteína de pico recombinante, expressa pelo Baculovírus cultivado em células Sf9</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, proteīna apakšvienība, rekombinantais smailes proteīns, kas izteikts ar Baculovirus, kultivēts uz Sf9 šūnām.</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-03-31</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0689</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL053"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>covid19</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>covid-19</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>Chinese-Recombinant-Sf9-covid</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>COVID19recombinantvaccine(Sf9)</skos:hiddenLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0774">
    <rdfs:label>FSME-IMMUN 0,25 mL</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Impfstoff gegen Frühsommer-Meningoenzephalitis (Vollvirus inaktiviert)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο κατά της εγκεφαλίτιδας που προκαλείται από κρότωνες (αδρανοποιημένο με ολόκληρο τον ιό)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko kleszczowemu zapaleniu mózgu (inaktywowana całym wirusem)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Ērču encefalīta vakcīna (inaktivēta ar veselu vīrusu)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a encefalite transmitida por carraças (vírus inteiro inactivado)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin entier inactivé contre l'encéphalite à tiques, souche Neudörfl, dose pédiatrique</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Tick-borne encephalitis vaccine, whole-virus inactivated, pediatric dose</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-09</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0774</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL315"/>
