  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0771">
    <rdfs:label>VBI-2902a</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">COVID-19 vaccine, VLP, recombinant spike protein, with adjuvant (aluminum phosphate)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin anti-covid 19 à VLP, protéine de pointe recombinante, avec adjuvant (phosphate d'aluminium)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">COVID-19-Impfstoff, VLP, rekombinantes Spike-Protein, mit Adjuvans (Aluminiumphosphat)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο COVID-19, VLP, ανασυνδυασμένη πρωτεΐνη αιχμής, με βοηθητικό (φωσφορικό αργίλιο)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka COVID-19, VLP, rekombinowane białko kolca, z adiuwantem (fosforan glinu)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina COVID-19, VLP, proteína de pico recombinante, com adjuvante (fosfato de alumínio)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">COVID-19 vakcīna, VLP, rekombinants smailes proteīns, ar palīgvielu (alumīnija fosfātu)</rdfs:comment>
