  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0511">
    <rdfs:label>SILGARD</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-07-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Human Papillomavirus vaccine, based on VLP (Virus Like Particles), nonavalent (types 6, 11, 16, and 18), recombinant, adsorbed</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin contre les papillomavirus humains à base de VLP (Virus Like Particles ou pseudo particules virales), quadrivalent (types 6, 11, 16 et 18), recombinant, adsorbé</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Humaner Papillomavirus-Impfstoff, basierend auf VLP (Virus Like Particles), nicht-avalent (Typen 6, 11, 16 und 18), rekombinant, adsorbiert</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Cilvēka papilomas vīrusa vakcīna, kuras pamatā ir VLP (vīrusiem līdzīgās daļiņas), neavalenta (6., 11., 16. un 18. tips), rekombinantā, adsorbētā veidā.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra o Papilomavírus Humano, baseada em VLP (Vírus como Partículas), não cavalente (tipos 6, 11, 16, e 18), recombinante, adsorvida</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko wirusowi brodawczaka ludzkiego, oparta na cząsteczkach VLP (Virus Like Particles), niewalentna (typy 6, 11, 16 i 18), rekombinowana, adsorbowana</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο για τον ιό των ανθρώπινων θηλωμάτων, με βάση VLP (Virus Like Particles), μη σθενές (τύποι 6, 11, 16 και 18), ανασυνδυασμένο, προσροφημένο</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-10-28</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0511</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL239"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL241"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL238"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL240"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL052"/>
