    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Impfstoff gegen Diphtherie (Toxoid, reduzierte Dosis) und Tetanus (Toxoid)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a difteria (toxoide, dose reduzida) e o tétano (toxoide)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο διφθερίτιδας (τοξοειδές, μειωμένη δόση) και τετάνου (τοξοειδές)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko błonicy (toksoid, dawka zmniejszona) i tężcowi (toksoid)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Difterijas (toksoīda, samazinātā deva) un stingumkrampju (toksoīda) vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (reduced dose) and tetanus toxoid vaccine</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-03-15</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0993</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL067"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL034"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1404">
