  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1007">
    <rdfs:label>ISTIVAC4</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-07-29</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin contre la grippe saisonnière inactivé quadrivalent, à virion fragmenté</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Quadrivalent inactivated seasonal influenza vaccine, split virion</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Vierwertiger inaktivierter Impfstoff gegen die saisonale Grippe, Spaltvirion</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Τετραδύναμο αδρανοποιημένο εμβόλιο κατά της εποχικής γρίπης, διαιρεμένου ιού</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Czterowalentna inaktywowana szczepionka przeciwko grypie sezonowej, z rozszczepionym wirionem</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a gripe sazonal quadrivalente inactivada, virião fraccionado</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Četrivalenta inaktivēta sezonālās gripas vakcīna, dalītā virionu vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-15</dct:modified>
