  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0900">
    <rdfs:label>PREVENAR 20</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-04-13</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Pneumococcal polysaccharide conjugate vaccine, 20-valent, adsorbed, serotypes 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F and 33F - Other name : Prevnar 20 in the USA</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Pneumokokken-Polysaccharid-Konjugatimpfstoff, 20-valent, adsorbiert, Serotypen 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F und 33F - Andere Bezeichnung: Prevnar 20 in den USA</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Pneimokoku polisaharīdu konjugētā vakcīna, 20-valenta, adsorbēta, 1., 3., 4., 5., 6.A, 6.A, 6.B, 7.F, 8., 9.V, 10.A, 11.A, 12.F, 14., 15.B, 18.C, 19.A, 19.F, 22.F, 23.F un 33.F serotips - cits nosaukums: Prevnar 20 ASV.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina conjugada de polissacarídeos pneumocócicos, 20-valente, adsorvida, serótipos 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F e 33F - Outro nome : Prevnar 20 nos EUA</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Polisacharydowa szczepionka pneumokokowa, 20-walentna, adsorbowana, serotypy 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F i 33F - inna nazwa: Prevnar 20 w USA</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Πνευμονιοκοκκικό πολυσακχαριδικό συζευγμένο εμβόλιο, 20δύναμο, προσροφημένο, ορότυποι 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F και 33F - Άλλη ονομασία : Prevnar 20 στις ΗΠΑ</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin pneumococcique polyosidique conjugué, 20-valent, adsorbé, sérotypes 1, 3, 4, 5, 6A, 6B, 7F, 8, 9V, 10A, 11A, 12F, 14, 15B, 18C, 19A, 19F, 22F, 23F et 33F - Nouveau nom depuis le 12/03/2024 (auparavant : APEXXNAR)</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-10-21</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0900</skos:notation>
