  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1047">
    <rdfs:label>ABRYSVO</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-07-23</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Elpceļu sincitiskā vīrusa (RSV) vakcīna, RSV A un B apakštipa rekombinantie prefūzijas F glikoproteīni, bez adjuvanta</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο αναπνευστικού συγκυτιακού ιού (RSV), γλυκοπρωτεΐνες F ανασυνδυασμένης σύντηξης των υποτύπων Α και Β του RSV, μη ανοσοενισχυτικά</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra vírus sincicial respiratório (VSR), glicoproteínas F de pré-fusão recombinantes de subtipos A e B de VSR, sem adjuvante</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko wirusowi Syncytialnego układu oddechowego (RSV), rekombinowana prefuzja, glikoproteiny F podtypów A i B RSV, bez adiuwanta</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Impfstoff gegen das Respiratory Syncytial Virus (RSV), rekombinante Präfusion von F-Glykoproteinen der RSV-Subtypen A und B, ohne Adjuvans</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin contre le virus respiratoire syncytial (VRS), recombinant, glycoprotéines F (préfusion), bivalent (sous-types A et B du VRS), sans adjuvant</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Respiratory Syncytial Virus (RSV) vaccine, recombinant prefusion F glycoproteins of RSV, bivalent (subtypes A and B), non-adjuvanted</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-11-28</dct:modified>
