  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC0905">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Vaccin Rage PHKCV, sans précision</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Rabies vaccine PHKCV, unspecified</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="gr">Αντιλυσσικό εμβόλιο PHKCV, απροσδιόριστο</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka przeciwko wściekliźnie PHKCV, nieokreślona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">Tollwutimpfstoff PHKCV, nicht spezifiziert</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="lv">Vakcīna pret trakumsērgu PHKCV, neprecizēta</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pt">Vacina anti-rábica PHKCV, não especificada</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-04-19</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin rabique entier inactivé, préparé en culture primaire de cellules rénales de hamster (PHKCV), souche Beijing, inactivaté par le formol</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Inaktivierter Tollwut-Vollvirusimpfstoff auf Zellkulturbasis, primärer Hamster-Nierenzellimpfstoff (PHKCV), Stamm Beijing, Inaktivierung mit Formalin</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra a raiva virion total inactivada, baseada em cultura celular, vacina primária contra as células renais de hamster (PHKCV), estirpe de Pequim, inactivação com formalina</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Visa vīriona inaktivēta trakumsērgas vakcīna, uz šūnu kultūru bāzes, primārā kāmja nieru šūnu vakcīna (PHKCV), Pekinas celms, inaktivācija ar formalīnu</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Inaktywowana szczepionka zawierająca całe wirusy wścieklizny, oparta na kulturach komórkowych, szczep z pierwotnych komórek nerkowych chomika (PHKCV), szczep pekiński, inaktywacja formaliną</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Αδρανοποιημένο εμβόλιο λύσσας με ολόκληρο τον ιό, με βάση την κυτταροκαλλιέργεια, εμβόλιο πρωτογενών νεφρικών κυττάρων χάμστερ (PHKCV), στέλεχος Beijing, αδρανοποίηση με φορμόλη</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Whole virion rabies inactivated vaccine, cell culture-based, primary hamster kidney cell vaccine (PHKCV), Beijing strain, inactivated with formalin</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-19</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC0905</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL261"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1003">
    <rdfs:label>TEDIVAX PRO ADULTO</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Vaccine"/>
    <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2022-07-29</dct:created>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Vaccin diphtérique (anatoxine, dose réduite) et tétanique (anatoxine)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Diphtheria toxoid (low dose) and tetanus toxoid vaccine</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Diphtherie-Toxoid (niedrige Dosis) und Tetanus-Toxoid-Impfstoff</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gr">Εμβόλιο τοξοειδούς διφθερίτιδας (χαμηλή δόση) και τοξοειδούς τετάνου</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Vacina contra difteria toxoide (dose baixa) e tétano toxoide</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="lv">Difterijas toksoīda (zema deva) un stingumkrampju toksoīda vakcīna</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pl">Szczepionka zawierająca toksoid błoniczy (niska dawka) i toksoid tężcowy</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-15</dct:modified>
    <skos:notation>VAC1003</skos:notation>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL067"/>
    <nuvs:containsValence rdf:resource="#VAL034"/>
    <nuvs:isAbstract rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</nuvs:isAbstract>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#VAC1136">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Vaccin Pneumocoque conjugué 23-valent, sans précision</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">23-valent Pneumococcus conjugate vaccine, unspecified</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="gr">Πνευμονιοκοκκικό 23-δύναμο συζευγμένο εμβόλιο, απροσδιόριστο</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pt">Vacina pneumocócica conjugada 23-valente, não especificada</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">23-valenter konjugierter Pneumokokken-Impfstoff, nicht näher bezeichnet</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pl">23-walentna skoniugowana szczepionka przeciw pneumokokom, nieokreślona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="lv">Pneimokoku 23-valenta konjugētā vakcīna, neprecizēta</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
